ss=\"strong\">rhythm</span> or \"beat\". <br>Word stress is emphasis on <span class=\"strong\">one syllable</span> within a <span class=\"strong\">word</span>.<br>Sentence stress is emphasis on <span class=\"strong\">certain words</span> within a <span class=\"strong\">sentence</span>.<br>Most sentences have two basic types of words:<br><br><span class=\"strong\">content words</span><br><ul><li> Content words are the important or key words in a sentence. They provide the meaning of the sentence.</li></ul><br><span class=\"strong\">structure words</span><br><ul><li> Structure words are not important words. They are small words that you use to make the sentence correct. </li></ul><br>Stressing New Information <br><br>You pronounce new information with more breath force, since it is more prominent.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Remember when he <span class=\"strong\">rudely messaged</span> you at <span class=\"strong\">two</span> o'clock in the <span class=\"strong\">morning</span> about that <span class=\"strong\">party</span>? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Yeah, I was <span class=\"strong\">not impressed</span>.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "straggler ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person or animal that moves slower than others and becomes separated from them ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are a few stragglers but we've got to make sure we cross people off the list when they respond.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a conversation about a dinner party.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mindful   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "aware of something that may be important ", "type": "definition"}, {"c