ng of words.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": "You create the <span class = \"italic\">\"m\"</span> sound by closing your lips and touching the top of your mouth behind your teeth to block the air.  ", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}, {"content": "You create the  <span class = \"italic\">\"n\"</span> sound by having your lips open and your tongue touching the top of your mouth behind your teeth to block the air.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 1}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">\nListen to the audio. </span> <span class=\"bullet\">\nRecord yourself saying the words or sentences aloud.</span>\n <span class=\"bullet\">\nCompare yourself to the audio.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "SR1", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK, who has still not responded to the RSVP? I think it's a little inconsiderate of them.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: There are a few stragglers but we've got to make sure we cross people off the list when they respond.  I'm not sure if we want people to come if they are not mindful of dates, times and others.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, Deanna from work is a nervous type and to be honest, a little neurotic around people she doesn't know.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I see Michael hasn't replied either. I'm sure he will though. He always tends to be motivated by food and I included a menu in the invitation.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He's also a little mischievous.  Remember that time he rudely messaged you at two o'clock in the morning about being a fighter pilot?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, I was not impressed, especially when he drives a bus.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We've got to uninvite him, I think.", "id": 2, "time": "22000", "image": "engenn6le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What about the saxophonist you met at the party? You said he had a magnetic personality. Have you heard from him?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe, we'll see. I've got to see if he'll play a solo for us.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's a shame. Who else is on the list?", "id": 3, "time": "43000", "image": "engenn6le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le16ob04re6aud08", "type": "audio"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}]}]}